{"title":"Gem Amber","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Source not yet observed</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div class=\"s muted\">No monster drops recorded for this item.</div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>22</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1\">1c <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2\">2c <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=3\">3c</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=4\">4c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 4c. Up to 2c can be made at the witch, so those count as common; bigger ones only come from finds, and a 4c gem is very rare.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Amber found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Prospector)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>22 <span class=\"muted\">(56%)</span></td><td>60%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>Prospector: ≈1% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>7 <span class=\"muted\">(18%)</span></td><td>14%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+ or the witch (3 × 0.5c)</td><td>Prospector: 2% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(7.7%)</span></td><td>9.7%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+ or the witch (3 × 1c)</td><td>Prospector: ≈3% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>5 <span class=\"muted\">(13%)</span></td><td>7.3%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+ or the witch (3 × 1.5c)</td><td>Prospector: 4% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(2.6%)</span></td><td>4.6%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Prospector: ≈5% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"